message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "In-Sample LD & Fine-Mapping Pipeline"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
authors:
  - family-names: "Chalk"
    given-names: "James"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChalkJ/In-Sample-LD-Fine-Mapping-Pipeline"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - fine-mapping
  - GWAS
  - SuSiE
  - FINEMAP
  - linkage disequilibrium
  - HPC
  - SLURM
  - genomics
abstract: >
  A self-contained SLURM/HPC pipeline that takes GWAS summary statistics
  from sumstats quality control through clumping, locus definition,
  in-sample linkage-disequilibrium (LD) generation, and config-driven
  fine-mapping (SuSiE / FINEMAP / both / none), producing per-SNP results
  tables, genome-wide summary statistics, and locus-zoom plots.
